  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IT system for Slovak development cooperation evidence and reporting 2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Informa&#x10d;n&#xfd; syst&#xe9;m pre evidovanie a vykazovanie rozvojovej spolupr&#xe1;ce SR 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Budovanie informa&#x10d;n&#xe9;ho syst&#xe9;mu pre evidovanie a vykazovanie rozvojovej spolupr&#xe1;ce SR. Zah&#x155;&#x148;a &#xfa;pravy RIS.DEV v d&#xf4;sledku zmien smern&#xed;c OECD pre vykazovanie ODA a s&#xfa;visiace anal&#xfd;zy, asistenciu pri vyk&#xe1;zan&#xed; d&#xe1;t a overovan&#xed; v&#xfd;kazov s OECD, pr&#xed;pravu reportingov&#xe9;ho formul&#xe1;ra pre TOSSD a aktualiz&#xe1;ciu str&#xe1;nky slovakdev.sk.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Development of the IT system aimed at ensuring the evidence of development cooperation data and fulfilling the reporting obligations of the Slovak Republic. It includes updates to BIS.DEV pursuant the changes in OECD guidelines for ODA reporting and related analyzes, assistance in reporting the data and verifying reports with the OECD, preparation of a reporting form for TOSSD and updating the slovakdev.sk website.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
